   "content": "P1218 - CONTRACT FOR RESPONSE MAINTENANCE AND IMPROVEMENT  The contracts associated with this competition will deliver responsive maintenance, emergency repairs, void property works, civil engineering, asbestos services, fire safety works, and associated inspections across the Housing Executive's properties within the relevant region. The successful Supplier(s) will provide a 24/7/365 responsive repairs service, undertake technical and compliance inspections, manage multi‑trade repair tasks, and support statutory landlord obligations. Works include working in occupied and unoccupied homes, communal areas, and Housing Executive owned land and buildings. The Supplier(s) must meet extensive requirements in health and safety, customer care, IT integration, appointments, reporting, social value, environmental sustainability, and performance management, and must collaborate with the Housing Ex",
